      <title>Version 1.0.9</title>
      <sparkle:version>1.0.9</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.9</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <description><![CDATA[<h2>UFB 1.0.9</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>AE tab — renders/proxies subtabs:</b> After Effects folder tabs
      now show a subtab strip on the bottom pane, switching between the
      <i>renders</i> (default) and <i>proxies</i> subfolders. The choice
      is remembered per folder, and Tracker reveal links open the
      matching subtab.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
